WOW-BG3 benilla patch 0103: a canyon is no room, and ground in front of her stays.
A playtest outside in Orgrimmar: "ground is see-through and buildings up above are all cut". Orgrimmar's open
rock is MOGP-indoor groups, so 0091 and 0095 took two groups 110 x 97 yd as "the room she is in" and clipped
everything over 2 yd above her feet: 41% of his frame in an offline replay. A room wider than a house is no room:
no storey clip, no storeys taken. And 0090's floor rule fails on a ramp rising ahead of her: up-facing surfaces no
higher than her chest stay, as 0098 keeps walkable terrain; a roof is above her chest and still goes.
